OL,3,ABest thing we can offer young people is
OL,4,Afirst job - not benefit payment, Healey
OL,5,Atells Labour conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Healey promises a "new age of
OL,8,Findustrialisation", saying he is a
OL,9,F"proud optimist" who "believes in
OL,10,FBritain", in his first Labour
OL,11,Fconference speech as chancellor
OL,13,FSpeaking about young people who are not
OL,14,Fin education, employment, or training
OL,15,F(Neets), he says the government has a
OL,16,F"moral duty" to ensure it doesn't
OL,17,F"write" anyone off
OL,19,F"The best thing we can offer a young
OL,20,Fperson is not a benefit payment - it's
OL,21,Fa first job with training and a wage,"
OL,22,FHealey says to applause
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
